{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le15ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le15ob10re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le15ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn7le15ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-110\">Angela</span>: Look mom! I'm going to be a journalist!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela's mom</span>: What?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela</span>: Well, it's not 100% sure yet, but it looks promising! You know I've been wanting to be a journalist for ages!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela's mom</span>: Well, you've also talked a lot about being a scientist as well. I would keep my options open.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela</span>: I've been in touch with the editors of <span class=\"italic\">Cambridge Life</span>. I've also contacted one of their freelance journalists. They think I would be great as a journalist. They think I'm self-motivated, ambitious, a real go-getter!", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn7le15ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-110\">Angela's mom</span>: That's great, honey, but you don't have any journalism experience. You could talk to a few more people first.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela</span>: I know. I've been planning to enrol in some courses for a while, and now I see there's a one-year program at Western College.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela's mom</span>: Yes honey, but sometimes you tend to be shy and reserved around people. You're a bit of an introvert, darling. Maybe you should think a bit more about this idea. I wouldn't jump to any major decisions.\u00a0I see you more as a scientist.", "time": "34000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le15ob10re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-110\">Angela</span>: I've decided it would be boring to be a scientist. They have to be rational and logical all the time. Journalism sounds like a fascinating career. You get to travel all over the world!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela's mom</span>: Whatever you think, dear.", "time": "66000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about behavior and personality in the workplace.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things I have done or have been doing. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Are you more like an extrovert (you like talking to people) or an introvert (you don't like talking to people)?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Is it better to be an extrovert or an introvert? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Don't jump to any decisions!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Angela wan